        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='34186' id='12' type-v2='text' w='27692' x='71077' y='39884'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#333333'>This demo tool allows you to filter the map for the GPS route recorded for all or a selected year. The data can also be filtered by the speed recorded between GPS points. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333'>The speed between points and elevation gain was calcualted with ChatGPT for three years of uploaded GPX data and saved into a singel GeoJSON file with a unique ID added to each point. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333'>The logo was created with Goolge Gemini.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
